"Quelle est la différence entre la Haute-Ville et la Basse-Ville?": "What is the difference between the Upper Town and the Lower Town?",
"La Haute-Ville, sur le cap Diamant, a une vocation militaire et administrative depuis 1620; la Basse-Ville, au pied du cap, s’est peuplée de commerçants et d’artisans.": "The Upper Town, on Cap Diamant, has had a military and administrative role since 1620; the Lower Town, at the foot of the cape, filled with merchants and craftsmen.",
